<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Fixed display name isn't visible of players when turning on re-anim.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Made music player gui better.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Shifted VC BYPASS to defense category.

