<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Made chat spam better.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Added Skydestroyer in troll category.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Added fling GUI in troll category.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Added anti fling in defense category.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Added touch fling in movement > Physics category.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Added music player (still in dev) in the social category.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Themed the entire script UI to a vibrant Green and properly colored the Big Baseplate (F1).

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Completely re-wrote Friend Activity image loading to pull native, high-quality game thumbnails.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Fixed major logic bugs in Friend Activity where users idling on the website were marked as playing.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Added robust executor fallback for Friend Activity so friends with missing data show gracefully as "In Game".

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Fixed a critical compiler crash (Local variables limit exceeded) by cleaning up memory allocations.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Built dynamic Custom Keybind Boxes for "Toggle Interface" and "Minimize Window" that auto-resize based on key names.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Redesigned Basic Controls guide with explicit functions for Mac buttons (Red=Close, Yellow=Minimize, Green=Resize).

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Stacked Discord Integration Cards (Developer & mortal Discord) with quick-copy buttons.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Fixed a UI bug in Activity that caused the "No friends currently in-game" text to overlap onto the sub-tab bar.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Completely redesigned Update Logs & Shortcuts as premium System Message cards featuring the mortal logo, fading gradients, and yellow accents.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Added a state-saving Auto-Execute toggle for Shaders, Terrains, and Environments.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Increased thickness of the separator lines between navigation icons for better visibility.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Sped up the running UIGradient strokes across the sub-tab menus for a fluid animation.

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Divided Home page into sub-tabs (Dashboard, Activity, Update Logs, Shortcuts).

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Divided Main page into sub-tabs (Player, Server, Game).

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Divided Movement page into sub-tabs (Movement, Physics).

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Divided Visuals page into sub-tabs (World, Character, Screen, Highlights).

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Divided Social page into sub-tabs (Chat Spam, Script Chat, VC Bypass).

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Divided Trolling page into sub-tabs (Target, Attach).

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Divided Defense page into sub-tabs (Anti Stuffs, Hide User).

<font color="rgb(80, 255, 100)">+</font> Divided Animations page into sub-tabs (Reanim Emote, Character, Anim Copy).

